  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.06 High grade spruce or fir",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.06 “High grade spruce or fir” means tree length spruce or fir that is sold to sawmills as sawlogs and does not include spruce or fir that is sold as pulpwood to pulpmills or pulp yards.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24",
